# An atomic-batch entry outside strict ingest is applied straight away instead
# of staged for its batch's decision.
MODULE: AtomicAllOrNothingEntryAppliedUnstaged
TARGET: AtomicAllOrNothing
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an unjudged batch entry is applied before its decision
PERTURBS: Deliver

--- FIND
       ELSE /\ st' = [st EXCEPT ![e] = IF kind[e] = "Atomic" THEN "Staged" ELSE "Stored"]
            /\ tag' = [tag EXCEPT ![e] = stamp[e]]
--- REPLACE
       ELSE /\ st' = [st EXCEPT ![e] = "Stored"]
            /\ tag' = [tag EXCEPT ![e] = stamp[e]]
--- END
